pipeline rewrite and this site. commits:

- `bfada78` zine starter template: clean css, native api, compact
  listings, dividers, theme sync
- `05da50b` v2 generation pipeline with module engine and search index
- `1568d0f` contract modules, layouts and multilingual content
- `b38ce87` sccl and minimal themes with site config
- `0bda7ca` docs site preview (this site), themes reworked:
  nord-default as default, everforest-default, motherfuckingwebsite,
  404 page, preview server with 404 fallback

what you get on top of v1: instant client-side search over a build-time
index (~4kb js), url-prefix slot overrides that merge cumulatively, and
a fully cfg-driven layout.
